abstract: >-
  ProofTTL is a source-backed claim verification and fact-checking service
  founded and operated by Collin Anderson in New York. It checks scoped
  claims against public evidence and returns SUPPORTED, CONTRADICTED, or
  UNKNOWN verdicts with evidence and signed Fact Leases.
